+// iOS: getcontext/makecontext/swapcontext are not supported (ENOTSUP on an iPad Pro M2,
+// iPadOS 26.6.1), so fibers use a small arm64 context switch. It saves and restores only what
+// the AArch64 calling convention requires a callee to preserve: x19-x28, x29, x30, sp and
+// d8-d15. x18 is reserved by the platform and never touched.
